# Old Wix URLs (currysgrill.com) -> rebuilt pages. Kept pages (/, /menus, /reservations, /gift-card,
# /online-orders) serve at the same paths, so they need no rule. Never redirect a path a real page serves.
/experiences            /reservations   301
/experience-details     /reservations   301
/experience-details/*   /reservations   301
/home                   /               301
/menu                   /menus          301
/menus/*                /menus          301
/order-online           /online-orders  301
/gift-cards             /gift-card      301
/buffet                 /lunch-buffet   301
/blank                  /               301
/account/*              /               301
